  "loader_spec": "headerless CSV, 79,986 rows x 34 comma-separated columns; columns 0-32 = features f1..f33 (float64 as written), column 33 = class label in {2,3,4,5,11,12} (integers, NOT 0-based); row order is the stream order; no shuffling, no normalisation applied to the frozen file."
